      "note": "Status is policy-driven since 2026-08-03: 'unknown' used to be reported as OK, so a server that has never proven its integrity looked identical to one that proves it nightly. Grouped per instance because the finding is 'this instance never runs CHECKDB', not 112 separate database findings — the metric produces one row per database and the estate has 112 of them.",
      "report_policy": {
        "enabled": true,
        "condition_grouping": {
          "enabled": true,
          "event_code": "DATABASE_CHECKDB",
